Bug 1903685 - Fix manual filtering of selected messages in search views. r=mkmelin

Use the selected messages' real folder for filtering and error reporting.
Allow one selected message in any view, and restrict multiple-message filtering
to single-folder views.

Add browser coverage for real folders, saved searches, synthetic views, and
message tabs, including selection of the correct account's filters.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D340170

